        <item>
            <title>5.66</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 15:58:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>364</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>5.66</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.66</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Inpainting refinements.</b> Masking is now limited to the image itself, and the expand preview keeps the image's true aspect ratio.</li>
<li><b>Saved characters work as references.</b> Asking for an image with a saved character now reliably uses their reference image, even when nothing is selected.</li>
<li><b>Cleaner agent chat.</b> Long technical tool output is collapsed to a single expandable line.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
